DESCRIPTION:Do you like to read? Do you want to talk about books with fell
 ow book lovers? Come to the Library Book Club's fall kick-off event! Make 
 your own "TBR Jar" to keep track of books on your "To Be Read List" and ta
 lk about what you've read\, what you want to read\, and how to make time f
 or reading in a busy college schedule. Craft materials will be provided\, 
 but supplies are limited. First come first serve. The Library Book Club is
  open to all Holy Cross students\, faculty\, and staff. It is a low-pressu
 re environment to talk about reading and share a love of books. During thi
 s event we will also discuss what is planned for the rest of the semester 
